t='# Orchard-only returns: inputs and owner commands\n\n'
t+='All archive byte counts below are recorded in IDENT, not measured on Orchard. No Orchard command was run. `O=/project/community/jjyeung/okh7` is the recorded pool root; combine it with each relative return path in the table. '+c('NATIVE_ROUTED_READ_DEVS1_STEP544_20261115.md',47)+' and '+c('INVENTORY.md',28,I)+'. The shared raw bundle is `raw/orchard_only_cc886a29e4ef.tar` ('+c('LEFTOVER.md',4,I)+').\n\n'
